OL,3,ACouncil is letting staff down with fire
OL,4,Aand rehire plans, says worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council worker has accused Glasgow
OL,7,FCity Council of letting staff down
OL,8,Fafter it announced fire and rehire
OL,9,Fplans due to a stalemate over equal pay
OL,10,Fproposals.
OL,12,FThe council has threatened to sack more
OL,13,Fthan 23,000 members of staff and then
OL,14,Frehire them on new contracts after
OL,15,Fnegotiations broke down with unions.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
